        "original_id": "7d770bcf-fd61-5137-8a62-a80ca361092f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Norman Allen Adie\n- Organizations: Rank Organization, Twentieth Century Fox\n- Places: Scotland, London, United States, New York City, Rockefeller Center, Miami, Florida\n- Roles: theater owner, operator, developer, Ponzi schemer, inmate\n- Facilities: Radio City Music Hall, Federal Detention Center\n\nFacts:\n- Norman Allen Adie was born in Scotland on November 25, 1946.\n- Norman Allen Adie began his career in London with the Rank Organization and Twentieth Century Fox.\n- Norman Allen Adie later moved to the United States to work at Radio City Music Hall.\n- Radio City Music Hall is an entertainment venue located in Rockefeller Center in New York City.\n- Norman Allen Adie is a former theater owner, operator, and developer.\n- Norman Allen Adie confessed to being a Ponzi schemer.\n- Norman Allen Adie is presently inmate number 64354-054 at the Federal Detention Center in Miami, Florida.",
